{"ts":"2026-07-05T05:08:35.381Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-yql1"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Consolidate item annotation facets: comments/notes/learnings/files/docs/deps/append/test become one facet grammar (old spellings aliased)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Eight top-level commands (comments, notes, learnings, files, docs, deps, append, test) are all per-item annotation/link facets with near-identical shape (<id> plus --add/--remove/list). The pm-n7rr target surface names 'item facets' as ONE noun group of the ~15; this task implements it per the grammar ADR pm-pbyu — one shared facet implementation, each facet a verb of a single noun (exact spelling fixed at ADR acceptance), current spellings kept as hidden aliases via the pm-0z7n shim with one-line migration hints. Zero feature loss. Duplicate check: pm-9y8q (closed, internal dedup of the comments/notes/learnings stacks) and pm-zwpp (SDK promotion of the same primitives — complementary: that item is API layering, this one is CLI grammar only); no open overlap."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","simplification"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-05T05:08:35.381Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-05T05:08:35.381Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"One facet grammar covers all 8 annotation surfaces with identical flags and payloads; every old spelling dispatches through the alias shim with a migration hint; spelling-parity spec proves identical output old vs new; contracts, completions (bash/zsh/fish), docs, and MCP names regenerate from the contract table; top-level help lists item facets under a single noun entry."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-n7rr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-0z7n","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-05T05:08:35.381Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"44f28c05d63a368fd1a04b0d1c8a0237a2f3b68a15f034c45de401e60d2b174e","message":""}
